  m_text: "The Codex is your in-game encyclopedia for everything you have discovered.\n\n\u2022
    Each discovered Bitling is recorded with its name, Type, and details.\n\u2022
    Undiscovered Bitlings appear as ??? until you obtain or encounter them.\n\u2022
    Locked entries often have hints, such as \u201CDefeat a certain enemy\u201D or
    \u201CReach a certain area.\u201D\n\u2022 Shiny forms and evolved forms are treated
    as separate entries once discovered.\n\u2022 Newly discovered entries can be
    marked as \u201CNew\u201D until you view them.\n\nFILTERS\nThe Codex can be filtered
    and sorted to help you find what you need:\n\n\u2022 Sort A\u2013Z or Z\u2013A.\n\u2022
    Filter by Type (Fire, Water, Grass, etc.).\n\u2022 Show only unlocked or only
    locked entries.\n\nUse the Codex to track your collection, plan what to hunt
    next, and see how close you are to full completion."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fd5877e960ed2a74ba078959e05ea1be, type: 2}
