--- !u!114 &2106110971
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 2106110969}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 886766c76dce8114e980230b8bf3cd35, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  storyGroup: {fileID: 2106110972}
  tapButton: {fileID: 1664641449}
  headerText: {fileID: 1976235607}
  bodyText: {fileID: 435968784}
  pageCounterText: {fileID: 1658407702}
  pages:
  - header: Welcome to the Bitling World
    body: "Bitlings are living digital creatures created from fragments of lost data.\nThey\u2019re
      small, unpredictable, and full of potential\u2014each one capable of learning,
      working, and growing alongside you."
  - header: A Working Species
    body: "Bitlings aren\u2019t just companions\u2014they\u2019re workers.\nEach
      type excels at a specific job:\nFire Bitlings master the Forge, Water Bitlings
      thrive at the Harbor, Ice Bitlings operate the CryoLab, and many more.\nTheir
      jobs produce resources the world depends on."
  - header: The Rift Crisis
    body: 'Recently, unstable Rifts have begun appearing across every realm.

      Bitlings
      emerge confused, displaced, or endangered.

      Some are overworked, some
      undertrained, and others completely lost.

      The crisis threatens both
      Bitlings and the world they support.'
  - header: The Bitling Research Network
    body: "To protect Bitlings and keep vital job sites running, the Bitling Research
      Network\u2014BRN\u2014was formed.\nTheir mission: rescue displaced Bitlings,
      assign them to proper jobs, restore production, and discover the source of
      the Rifts."
  - header: Your New Role
    body: "You\u2019ve been recruited as a BRN Handler.\nYour responsibility is simple
      but important:\nTrain Bitlings, assign them to the right jobs, manage fatigue,
      boost production, and keep every job site running smoothly during the Rift
      crisis."
  - header: Begin Your Operation
    body: 'Every operation starts with one Bitling partner.

      Choose a starter
      to learn with, guide them into their first job, and work together to help stabilize
      the world one Bitling at a time.'
